<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>or slides in a rotating or swipable format, allowing users to navigate through a series of visual elements with optional text content.&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;This block’s table has 2 columns and multiple</p>
