<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>"html": "\n&lt;div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">  </span>&lt;div class=\"library-metadata\"&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>&lt;div&gt;blockName&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>&lt;div&gt;Hero&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>&lt;div&gt;description&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>&lt;div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;This block is used to capture users’ attention with</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">     </span>a prominent image, a headline, and an optional call-to-action, typically placed at the top of a page.&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;This block’s table has 1 column and 3 rows, with the first row containing only</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>the block name and optional variants. The single cell in the 2&lt;sup&gt;nd&lt;/sup&gt; row should contain:&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ol&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background Image&lt;/strong&gt; (optional)&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ol&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;The single cell in the 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt;</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>row may contains the following elements as text or richtext&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ol&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">            </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title&lt;/strong&gt; (optional) - styled as a Heading.&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;\n</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subheading&lt;/strong&gt; (optional)&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">            </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Call-to-Action&lt;/strong&gt; (optional) - text with a link.&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ol&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;There must never be more than 3</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>rows.&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;When rendered, CSS and JavaScript will display this block as a large banner, combining the background asset with text and an optional button.&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;When to use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;When</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">     </span>you need a strong visual statement at the top of a page.&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;To highlight a key message, offer, or brand identity.&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;When you want a clear, high-impact</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>call-to-action above the fold.&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;When to consider another block&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;If the layout requires more detailed content sections rather than a single headline.&lt;/li&gt;\n</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;/ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;When page space is limited, and a large banner would distract from other priorities.&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;li&gt;If you need multiple content elements or a more flexible layout below the</p>
<p class="p2"><span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>main image.&lt;/li&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;/ul&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">  </span>&lt;/div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">  </span>&lt;div class=\"hero\"&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">    </span>&lt;div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">      </span>&lt;div&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">        </span>&lt;picture&gt;\n<span class="Apple-converted-space">          </span>&lt;source type=\"image/webp\"</p>
